  "summary_en": "Civil society policy brief by Paradigm Initiative assessing Côte d'Ivoire's National AI and Data Governance Strategy. It identifies gaps in human rights safeguards, inclusion, outdated laws and implementation tracking, drawing on Kenya and Brazil, and recommends a rights-based framework with a human rights addendum and a Digital Rights Act.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Adopt a Human Rights Addendum to the National AI Strategy",
   "Enact a comprehensive Digital Rights Act in 2025",
   "Create a public milestone tracker with KPIs and semi-annual updates",
   "Establish a permanent multi-stakeholder task force on ethical AI",
   "Modernise outdated laws such as Personal Data Protection Law 2013-450"
  ],
